      "content": "thanks this is a good start. but i feel like it's a little too \"template\" sounding. since we're a high-end brand, can you make it feel a bit more personal and maybe add a little bit of a \"story\" or a more descriptive way to explain why the package might be delayed? like, instead of just saying it's stuck, maybe frame it as something unexpected happening at the facility so it doesn't sound like we just lost it.",
